---
layout: "layouts/base.njk"
title: Galeria
description: Zobacz świat Explore 4x4 w kadrach z wypraw i spotkań poza asfaltem.
permalink: /galeria/index.html
heroClass: subpage-hero-works
---
{% include "templates/subpage-hero.njk" %}

<section class="subpage-section works-page gallery-page" id="galeria">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <p class="section-kicker">Sprawdzone poza asfaltem</p>
      <h2>Przygoda<br>uchwycona w kadrze</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4">
      {% for photo in galleryImages %}
      <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4 fade-in">
        <a href="{{ photo.url }}" class="glightbox subpage-work-image gallery-image" data-no-swup data-gallery="galeria" data-title="" data-description="" aria-label="Powiększ zdjęcie {{ loop.index }}">
          {% galleryImage photo.source, "Explore 4x4 — zdjęcie " + loop.index %}
          <span class="image-action" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "sections/banner.njk" %}
